# File ini berisi contoh request untuk testing API dengan Postman atau REST Client VSCode

### Menambahkan data sensor (simulasi)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/sensor-data/simulate
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "userId": "67906a8703f043e82dc7e9a1",
    "deviceId": "ESP32_01",
    "count": 24
}

### Mengambil data sensor terbaru
GET http://localhost:5000/api/sensor-data/67906a8703f043e82dc7e9a1/latest

### Mengambil riwayat data sensor
GET http://localhost:5000/api/sensor-data/67906a8703f043e82dc7e9a1/history?limit=24

### Menambahkan data sensor manual
POST http://localhost:5000/api/sensor-data
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "userId": "67906a8703f043e82dc7e9a1",
    "deviceId": "ESP32_01",
    "temperature": 25.5,
    "ph": 6.5,
    "distance": 15.2,
    "ppm": 750
}

### Mengambil statistik data sensor
GET http://localhost:5000/api/sensor-data/67906a8703f043e82dc7e9a1/stats?period=24h

# Note: Ganti userId di atas dengan ID user yang actual dari database
